
Sandbox mode: --sandbox task  [Task Environment Sandbox]
  Isolated Python venv per task (via uv). Ensures correct package versions declared in task.yaml runtime.packages.
  Pros:  Cross-platform (no Docker needed); deterministic Python dependencies; fast cached venv reuse.
  Cons:  No filesystem or network isolation — agent still has full shell access and can read host files, reference answers, and other instances.


